Just for making things clearer: it seems that there are two different
regressions that happened casually on several Logitech keyboard
models.  One is by the commit 9d1bd9346241
  HID: logitech-dj: Add support for a new lightspeed receiver iteration
and another by the commit c7d80059b086
  leds: class: Store the color index in struct led_classdev

The former caused some missing event handling and the latter caused
the driver probe error.

Both commits need to be (more or less) reverted in the end.


